 "summary": "Both new files are in their natural homes: the Rolle-parametrized Thom theory beside its sole non-Mathlib dependency TauCeti/Algebra/Polynomial/Rolle.lean (matching the existing Sturm/GCD.lean and RealClosed/Quadratic.lean precedent for univariate real-algebraic material), and the Tarski-query reconstruction in the SignDetermination/ directory that owns signCount, tarskiQuery, and fullInverse. Every import is used \u2014 including Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic, which supplies the DenselyOrdered instance that Set.Ioo_infinite needs \u2014 and none is unnecessarily broad.",
